        "arcane",
        "earth"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The greater steel mephit breathes shards of iron in a 15ft Cone that deals 3d6 Slashing Damage damage to each creature within the area (Basic DC 19 Reflex Saving Throw save). Creatures who fail their save against this effect also take 1d6 Bleed Damage. The greater steel mephit can't use its breath weapon again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
